Let

(3.4)
\[ N (s) = r e^{- \frac{R_2}{2} s} N^{\sim} - \frac{1}{m} ( \frac{1}{a_2 c_2}
   - \frac{1}{a_1 c_1}) \left(\begin{array}{c}
