   915	{\tmstrong{3.4 Lemma}} Suppose that $m = n q^l$, $q \neq 2, 3 \tmop{is} a
   916	\tmop{prime} \tmop{factor},$ and $n, q$ relatively prime. Then
   917	\[ \tmop{either} q^{2 l} \tmop{divides} a_1 c_2 - c_1 a_2 \tmop{or} q^{2 l}
   918	   \tmop{divides} a_1 a_2 - c_1 c_2 . \]
