The transformed family is now exact on all presets and independent edge checks. The hidden basis is recoverable from \(B(0)=P^\mathsf{T}P\), the compact route reconstructs the planted witness without reading it in 259–265 counted operations, and the generic solver still recovers it by interpolation (about 8.45M operations at the new hard preset). I’m running the full 200,000-sample/8-seed gate suite next.
